    <releaseNotes><![CDATA[
# v3.4.0.50128

Added valid certificate fingerprint for log4net v3 
- https://github.com/solarwinds/OrionSDK/pull/411 - by @MichalLudik

Font size scaling fix
- https://github.com/solarwinds/OrionSDK/pull/407-  by @ViktorSydorov

string_agg added to autocomplete
- https://github.com/solarwinds/OrionSDK/pull/419 - by @ViktorSydorov

Fix FontSizeToolbar disposing the shared default font
- https://github.com/solarwinds/OrionSDK/pull/422 - by @tomvladik

Add support for OAuth connection type
- https://github.com/solarwinds/OrionSDK/pull/415 - by @etichy

]]></releaseNotes>
